 "scratch": "设计四株植物高度：A=15, B=20, C=10, D=25。最高是D(25)。平均=(15+20+10+25)/4=70/4=17.5。题目陈述：'这四株植物的平均高度比最高植株矮 8 厘米'。计算差值：25-17.5=7.5。7.5!=8，所以陈述错误。",
 "solver_code": "from decimal import Decimal\ndef solve():\n    h = [Decimal('15'), Decimal('20'), Decimal('10'), Decimal('25')]\n    avg = sum(h) / 4\n    max_h = max(h)\n    diff = max_h - avg\n    # 题目说差8，实际差7.5，故为错\n    return [diff == Decimal('8')]",
